WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.634
My name is Caitríona Balfe

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.270
I am in Belfast, the movie,
 and here's some

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.705
Tricks of the Trade

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.907
To nail a Belfast accent,

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:10.777
well first thing you have to learn
 is how to say ”Bout Ye”

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.145
And that means, “How are you?”

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:13.680
But who would even talk to you?

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.915
I think you have to learn
 to speak really fast

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.484
because everybody talks
 really fast like this. 

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.452
If they do get there,
 they should get to the moon. 

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.520
Somebody says here.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.256
Just remember to singsong everything you say.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:24.057
It did.

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.359
Now we have to cut
things out of the papers.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.094
And explain how they got there. 

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.197
Music's a huge one. 

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:36.102
With this project, actually Ken 
had sent a playlist of some songs.

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:39.439
I like to sometimes read something
 from that time period

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.741
or watch some films, and
that was also because

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.209
film was such a big
part of this.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:45.779
I like to do things
 like each of my characters wears

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.147
a different perfume. 

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:49.215
Perfume that didn't feel
like it should have been in

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.550
Belfast in the sixties.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.521
That little bit of glamour
 brought her to life for me,

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.322
and she just felt really familiar.

